# Preface & Legal Mumbo-Jumbo

## About This Abomination

rez2ans (a.k.a. rez2ansi) was coded by **Sudden Death**, an original member of the BBS/ANSI scene and co-founder of **Creators Of Intense Art** art group, with a frankly unreasonable amount of assistance from **Qwen30b LLM** (yes, an AI helped make software that makes art—wrap your head around that one). 

Built in **FreePascal/Lazarus** for Windows and Linux, because some of us still believe in cross-platform desktop apps that don't require 47 Electron instances and a Small Business Server™ just to convert a PNG.

This is the spiritual successor to **ansirez and ansicv22** and other scene tools.
